# 🚀 Day 35 – Prompt Puzzle: Master AI Prompting Through Play

## 📌 Challenge Overview

For **Day 35** of the **60 Days Claude AI Challenge by ABTalks**, I built **🧩 Prompt Puzzle – Master AI Prompting Through Play**, an interactive web application that transforms prompt engineering into a fun, gamified learning experience.

Instead of memorizing prompt templates, users improve their AI prompting skills by solving real-world challenges, comparing prompt quality, and understanding why optimized prompts generate better AI responses.

---

# 🎯 Project Objective

Prompt engineering is one of the most valuable AI skills today.

This project helps beginners and intermediate learners practice writing effective prompts through interactive puzzles, drag-and-drop activities, and performance-based feedback.

